# Store credentials and pinned CAs — fetched per environment, never committed
backend/certs/*
!backend/certs/README.md
*.p8
*.cer

# Local agent / scratch (never commit)
_p4_spec*.txt
*.orig
*.bak

# Exam ingestion working data. All of it is reproducible from the source PDF:
# figures and crops are extracted deterministically, and model responses are
# cached under work/. The published result lives in the database and the asset
# store, not in git.
tools/ingest/data/inbox/
tools/ingest/data/work/
tools/ingest/data/out/

# Figures written by the local asset store.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored while the local store is in use: the manifest points
# at /static/figures/..., so the files have to ship with the backend or every
# diagram 404s on the device. One paper is ~1.7MB, which git handles fine.
#
# This does not scale -- ten exams x ten years is hundreds of MB of binaries in
# history. Before ingesting past a handful of papers, switch to R2
# (INGEST_ASSET_STORE=r2, see tools/ingest/README.md) and restore this rule:
# backend/static/figures/
